<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1662074977"/></metadata></head><body dur="3:27.266"><div begin="31.165" end="1:00.474" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="31.165" end="37.119" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="31.165" end="31.828">雨</span><span begin="31.828" end="33.583">水</span> <span begin="34.041" end="34.589">趁风</span><span begin="34.589" end="35.083">把伞</span><span begin="35.083" end="35.718">吹</span><span begin="35.718" end="37.119">毁</span></p><p begin="37.979" end="45.888" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="37.979" end="38.448">将你</span><span begin="38.448" end="38.987">整个</span><span begin="38.987" end="40.381">包围</span> <span begin="40.381" end="41.685">侵蚀</span><span begin="41.865" end="42.736">你的</span><span begin="42.736" end="43.602">发</span><span begin="43.602" end="44.870">和</span><span begin="44.870" end="45.888">背</span></p><p begin="46.265" end="53.146" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="46.265" end="46.811">倔强</span><span begin="46.811" end="47.390">的</span><span begin="47.390" end="48.589">嘴</span> <span begin="49.678" end="50.215">绝不</span><span begin="50.215" end="50.680">能往</span><span begin="50.680" end="51.295">下</span><span begin="51.295" end="53.146">垂</span></p><p begin="53.407" end="1:00.474" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="53.407" end="53.647">只</span><span begin="53.647" end="54.119">摀住</span><span begin="54.119" end="54.529">耳朵</span><span begin="54.529" end="56.077">防备</span><span begin="56.077" end="57.057">突</span><span begin="57.057" end="57.530">袭</span><span begin="57.530" end="58.498">的响</span><span begin="58.498" end="1:00.474">雷</span></p></div><div begin="1:01.666" end="1:16.995" itunes:songPart="PreChorus"><p begin="1:01.666" end="1:04.692" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:01.666" end="1:01.882">你</span><span begin="1:01.882" end="1:02.402">说有</span><span begin="1:02.402" end="1:02.904">人伤</span><span begin="1:02.904" end="1:03.155">痕</span><span begin="1:03.155" end